security gresint

role viewer
role operator extends viewer
role manager extends operator

user ana email "ana@example.org" roles manager
user luis roles operator, viewer

grant viewer read on StationObservationEntity
grant viewer read on ZoneDimension
grant viewer read on Stations
grant viewer read on Zones
grant operator write on StationForm
grant operator write on ZoneForm
grant manager admin on StationObservationEntity
